<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Mar c/a deficit widens to 5.2 bln ATS.</title>
<headline>Austria Mar c/a deficit widens to 5.2 bln ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN CURRENT ACCOUNT     MARCH     FEBRUARY	MARCH 96</p>
<p> Current account balance ATS -5.2 bln   -3.5 bln	  -3.0</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance   -9.6 bln   -6.6 bln	  -7.3</p>
<p> Exports			   59.5 bln   58.2 bln	  54.7</p>
<p> Imports			   69.1 bln   64.8 bln	  62.0</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (JANUARY TO MONTH IN QUESTION)</p>
<p> Current account balance ATS -8.0 bln   -2.8 bln	   8.1</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance  -24.8 bln  -15.2 bln	 -14.7</p>
<p> Exports			  181.2 bln  121.8 bln	 181.2</p>
<p> Imports			  206.1 bln  137.0 bln	 196.0</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
